// Lawrence County, Ohio — curated directory of meaningful links.
// Single source of truth for the app. Keep entries verified and current.
// Fields: name, category, subcategory, url, description
// Last reviewed: 2026-11-10
//
// Every URL below was fetched and its content checked against the organization
// it claims to be. Pages that block automated fetching (the Auditor's property
// search, the Treasurer, the Briggs library, the ADAMHS board and the
// OhioMeansJobs center) were checked in a browser.
//
// THINGS THAT CHANGED SINCE JULY
//
//   * The Auditor's property search is Pivot Point (lawrencecountyauditor.org); the
//     July "OnTrac" label belonged to Licking County.
//   * The City of Ironton's site is irontonohio.org (ironton-ohio.com redirects).
//   * The Common Pleas Court is at lawcocp.us (General Division).
//   * Symmes Valley Local Schools' current site is svlsd.com.
//   * King's Daughters' Lawrence County offices are now on ukkingsdaughters.com.
//   * Ohio University Southern's Proctorville Center was sold to Collins Career
//     Technical Center.
//   * OhioMeansJobs now points to the county center (omjlawrencecounty.org).
//   * The Lawrence Register is a history and genealogy site, not a newspaper.
//
// TRAPS
//
//   Lawrence County PA/KY/IN/AL/TN/MS/MO/AR/IL/SD; Ironton MO/MN; Chesapeake VA;
//   Huntington WV and Ashland and Russell KY are across the river; Boyd County KY and
//   Cabell County WV bodies; lawrencecountyprosecutor.org is a parked domain.
//
// GEOGRAPHY
//
//   * One city (Ironton, the seat). South Point has a site; Chesapeake, Coal Grove,
//     Proctorville, Hanging Rock and Athalia have none found.
//   * Seven school districts (Ironton City, Chesapeake Union EV, Dawson-Bryant,
//     Fairland, Rock Hill, South Point, Symmes Valley), the Lawrence County ESC,
//     Collins Career Technical Center and Ohio University Southern.
//   * Hospitals are across the river; their Lawrence County offices are listed. The
//     Ironton-Lawrence County CAO runs the FQHC, Head Start, WIC, transit and senior
//     services. Mental health is the Adams-Lawrence-Scioto ADAMHS Board.
//
// LEFT OUT
//
//   * lawrenceclerk.com (certificate error), lawrencecountyprosecutorsoffice.com and
//     lcems.us (no longer load), an expired campground domain.
//   * Probate/juvenile court, coroner, SWCD, solid waste, 911, EMA (Facebook only),
//     museum, county fair, humane society, United Way and Habitat: no site found.
//   * Research hit a page-fetch limit; townships, fire departments and some city
//     pages were not fully searched.

